 core gameplay for yourself.What can you try in the demo?The demo gives you a first look at the main systems of Extravalence:⚔️ Combat 🧪 Elemental bonds and reactions 🗺️ Exploration 👥 Party building 🎮 Core progression and gameplay mechanicsThis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T22:11:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690502","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140550-1842846814453956","game_id":"steam-5140550","kind":"announcement","title":"🧪 Extravalence Playtest Is Now Public!","summary":"🧪 Extravalence Playtest Is Now Public!Hello, chemists! ✨I have some exciting news:The Extravalence Playtest is now open to everyone!You no longer need to wait for manual approval or selection — if you want to try the game, you can now join the Playtest directly through Steam.What can you expect?The public Playtest includes an early version of Extravalence with its core systems already available to try:⚔️ Combat 🧪 Elemental bonds and reactions 🗺️ Exploration 👥 Party building 🎮 Core progression an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T19:48:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453956","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140550-1842846814447904","game_id":"steam-5140550","kind":"announcement","title":"🧪 The Closed Extravalence Playtest Is Now Live!","summary":"🧪 The Closed Extravalence Playtest Is Now Live!Hello, chemists! ✨The first closed Extravalence Playtest has officially begun!If you previously requested access through Steam, check your library - Extravalence Playtest is now available for approved participants.The playtest runs on September 5 and 6, and this is your first